  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat a skillet over medium heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add almonds to the skillet; cook, stirring occasionally, until lightly toasted, 2-3 minutes. Set aside to cool."
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine yogurt, honey, and almond butter in a medium bowl and whisk until smooth."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and cut grapes into halves."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide yogurt, grapes, and almonds between jars or bowls, alternating ingredients to create layers. Enjoy!"
